    "title": "Football Recap: Williston Skates Past Paxon School for Advanced Studies with Ease - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Team Reports ,\n19 hours ago A well-balanced attack led Williston over Paxon School For Advanced Studies in every quarter on their way to victory on Friday. Given that consistent dominance, it should come as no surprise that the Red Devils blew the Golden Eagles out of the water with a 49-7 final score. Given the Red Devils' advantage in MaxPreps' Florida football rankings (they are ranked 120th, while the Golden Eagles are ranked 357th) , the win wasn't entirely unexpected. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
